L42i Paper Template — License
================================================================

This template — L42i_paper_template.tex, L42i_paper_template.bib,
README.md, and the figures/ folder — is a modified version of the ACM
"acmart" sample file sigconf.tex, by Boris Veytsman.

It is distributed under the LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL),
version 1.3c or later — the same license as acmart. As the LPPL
requires for a modified work, it has been renamed (the main file is
L42i_paper_template.tex, distinct from sigconf.tex) and is marked as a
modified version.

The full text of the LPPL v1.3c is at:
    https://www.latex-project.org/lppl/lppl-1-3c/

Modifications (c) 2026 Henrik von Coler,
Lab for Interaction and Immersion (L42i),
Georgia Institute of Technology, School of Music.

